                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Elle's Stories for Kids",
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Welcome to Shape Land—where every shape has a story! In this audio series for young children, you’ll meet six cheerful shapes: Triangle, Square, Circle, Pentagon, Rectangle, and Hexagon. Each story brings playful adventures packed with counting and curiosity—from lost hats and birthday parties to homemade books and nature treasure hunts. *Adventures in Shape Land* helps kids aged 3–6 learn about shapes and numbers in a fun, memorable way, with interactive moments, humour, and catchphrases. With engaging voices, and interesting background sounds, these stories will captivate your child.   Perfect for bedtime, car rides, or anytime your little one wants a bite-sized story full of imagination!",
